---
import Claim from './Claim.astro';
---
<figure class="cm">
  <table>
    <caption class="sr-cap">Analyzer results on 15 scenarios</caption>
    <thead>
      <tr><td></td><th scope="col">Flagged</th><th scope="col">Not flagged</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <th scope="row">Has a failure</th>
        <td class="good"><Claim id="iia.tp" /><span>caught</span></td>
        <td class="bad"><Claim id="iia.fn" /><span>missed</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th scope="row">Correct code</th>
        <td class="bad"><Claim id="iia.fp" /><span>false alarms</span></td>
        <td class="good"><Claim id="iia.tn" /><span>left alone</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <figcaption>
    All five errors are in the five hard cases built to sit outside the analyzer's documented limits.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .cm {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 1.25rem;
    font-family: var(--sans);
  }
  table {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .sr-cap {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip-path: inset(50%);
  }
  th {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-align: left;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.9rem 0.3rem 0;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }
  thead th {
    padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  thead td {
    border: 0;
  }
  tbody td {
    padding: 0.55rem 0.9rem;
    min-width: 7.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  td :global(.claim) {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-right: 0.45rem;
  }
  td span:not(:global(.sr)) {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }
  .bad {
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
</style>
